/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_802A0870` at `0x802A0870` (28 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/802a0870_FUN_802a0870.c`
/// - Raw check: `work/dol/main.elf` at `0x802A0870..0x802A0888`
