/// - Ghidra: `FUN_802A0890` at `0x802A0890` (16 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/802a0890_FUN_802a0890.c`
/// - Raw check: `work/dol/main.elf` at `0x802A0890..0x802A089C`
