/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_802A8990` at `0x802A8990` (56 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/802a8990_FUN_802a8990.c`
/// - Raw check: `work/dol/main.elf` at `0x802A8990..0x802A89C8`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `dst` - seven-word destination (`r3`).
/// * `first` - first 3-word source (`r4`).
/// * `second` - second 3-word source (`r5`).
