/// Loads either the object's matrix or a concatenated matrix, then draws.
///
/// When the sign bit of `descriptor+0x50` is set, the function concatenates
/// `descriptor+4` with `object+0x84` into a local matrix and loads that;
/// otherwise it loads `object+0x84` directly. Both paths then call
/// `0x801C9940(matrix, 0)` and `0x801C9A60(0)`.
