/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8029c080_FUN_8029c080.c`
/// - Raw check: `work/dol/main.elf` at `0x8029C080..0x8029C7C0`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `object` - material state object.
/// * `param_2` - material descriptor (`+0x20..` colours, `+0xC8` owner).
/// * `param_3` - per-channel selector table (`+0x61`, `+0x64`, `+0x69`,
///   `+0x6C`, `+0x71`).
