/// Sums the release cost of one texture-list bucket.
///
/// The bucket is `*(object+0xC018) + index*0x1C`. Its entries are drained
/// into a local array by `0x802957D0`, then each entry is passed to
/// `0x80285CE0` and the returned counts are summed.
