/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80286A30` at `0x80286A30` (144 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/80286a30_FUN_80286a30.c`
/// - Raw check: `work/dol/main.elf` at `0x80286A30..0x80286AC0`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `object` - texture-list owner.
/// * `index` - bucket index (stride `0x1C`).
