/// # Returns
/// Sum of the per-entry counts.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Destroys every entry in the bucket.
///
/// # Safety
/// `object` readable at `+0xC018`; the bucket's `+0x08` count must fit the
/// local 1,026-word array.
///
/// # Confidence
