/// - Ghidra: `FUN_8028CD70` at `0x8028CD70` (356 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/8028cd70_FUN_8028cd70.c`
/// - Raw check: `work/dol/main.elf` at `0x8028CD70..0x8028CED4`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `record` - selector record (`+0x02` mode, `+0x0C` fallback source).
/// * `param_2` - hash input / fallback pointer.
/// * `descriptor` - hash input (`+0x06`).
/// * `textures` - word table of command entries.
/// * `table` - optional modulo table (`u16` count at `+0`).
/// * `object` - draw object (`+0xC8` chain, `+0xE2` id).
/// * `seed` - hash seed.
///
