/// Builds a 3x4 matrix in two modes from nine source floats.
///
/// `mode == 0` keeps the source columns and offsets the translation by the
/// per-axis products of `m0..m4`; `mode == 1` folds the second column into the
/// third and negates the translation. Both arms are transcribed store by
/// store from the export. `// inferred:` the twelve outputs are a 3x4
/// matrix/rectangle block; the five scalars are extents and offsets.
