/// Samples a falloff ramp at `value` over the `[0, 2]` domain.
///
/// `value` is clamped to `[0.0, 2.0]` (NaN takes the upper bound), converted to
/// a ramp index `(int)(0.5 + 256.0 * (value * 0.5))` and used to read one float
