/// Builds the four fixed-point corner positions and one `(u, v)` pair per
/// corner for a single cell of the texture grid.
///
/// Every corner starts as `base * width` where `base` is `object+0xC0` and the
/// four widths are `+0xC4`, `+0xC8 + cell[0x3C]`, `+0xCC` and `+0xD0`, each
/// clamped to `[0, 1]`. The cell is `object + col*0x18`, so the `0x18`-byte
/// table at `+0x34..+0x3C` is indexed by the second grid coordinate. When bit 0
/// of `object+0xBC` is clear all five stay `0.0`.
