/// The cell position `(object+0xAC, object+0xB0) + cell[0x34, 0x38]`, plus
/// `-1`, `0` or `+1` when `object+0x8C == 2` and `row` is 1 or 0, is either
/// projected onto a rounded box by [`fn_80282040`] (mode `2` of
