/// - Ghidra: `FUN_802821E0` at `0x802821E0` (2,988 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/802821e0_FUN_802821e0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `object` - texture-grid object (`r3`); flags at `+0xBC`, mode at `+0xF8`.
/// * `row` - first grid coordinate (`r4`); selects the `-1`/`+1` edge bias.
/// * `col` - second grid coordinate (`r5`); indexes the `0x18`-byte cell table.
/// * `positions` - 12-writable-`u16` buffer for the four corners (`r6`).
/// * `uvs` - 8-writable-`u16` buffer, one `(u, v)` pair per corner (`r7`).
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes 24 bytes to `positions` and 16 bytes to `uvs`; calls the two ramp
/// samplers and the box projector.
///
/// # Safety
/// `object` must be readable through `+0xF8`, `positions` must be writable for
/// 12 halfwords and `uvs` for 8.
///
/// # Confidence
