/// `lwz r0,0xE8(r4)`, `stw r0,0(r3)` and `blr`: the word at
/// `base + 0xE8 + 4*index` is stored through `out`. The `+0xE8` block is the
/// four-element `ut::Color` array the `wnd1` destructor tears down.
