/// # Arguments
/// - `base`: the window/pane record (`r3`).
/// - `index`: colour index 0..3 (`r4`), scaled by four.
/// - `src`: four readable bytes (`r5`).
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Four byte writes into `base + 0xE8`.
