// ===========================================================================
// Wave 278 lane D (`_D278`) - the 13 uncovered slots of the `0x803294D8`
// layout-root vtable
// ===========================================================================
//
// **Shape.** `0x803294D8` carries the same two-word zero header as every other
// vtable in this cluster (`0x803294D8 = 0x803294DC = 0`), the method array is
// `0x803294E0..0x80329518` (14 words, 56 bytes) and the next header starts at
// `0x80329518` (again `0, 0`). The maximal text-pointer run forward is exactly
// 14 words and 0 words backward, all 14 words are distinct, none is null, none
// points outside `.text`, and none is an interior label of a `functions.tsv`
// extent. So this is a plain **class vtable**, not an index table: dispatch is
// by fixed immediate offset from the installed vptr, i.e. slot `k` lives at
// `vptr + 8 + 4*k`.
//
// **Who installs it.** In the whole image set (main DOL + the four REL ELFs)
// only two `lis`/`addi` pairs materialise `0x803294D8`, and no aligned data
// word does:
//
// | site | `lis` | `addi` | store |
// |---|---|---|---|
// | `0x80006D08` | `0x80006D08` (`0x8033`) | `0x80006D10` (`+0x94D8`) | `stw r4,0(r31)` @ `0x80006D14`, `r31 = this + 0x10` |
// | `0x80163918` | `0x80163918` | `0x80163920` | `stw r4,0(r31)` @ `0x80163924`, `r31 = this + 0x10` |
//
