// | 2 | 1 | `0x803294E4` | `0x802ACCB0` | `0x802ACCB0..0x802ACFFC` | 844 | `RLYT` layout build |
// | - | 2 | `0x803294E8` | `0x802AD000` | `0x802AD000..0x802AD080` | 128 | already translated above |
// | 3 | 3 | `0x803294EC` | `0x801634D0` | `0x801634D0..0x80163520` | 80 | derived clone: slot 4, then unlink |
