/// `this` must be null or a live member object allocated by this class's
/// allocator.
///
/// # Confidence
/// high - both guards, the two calls and the `r3` reload are literal; the
/// base-vtable twin `0x8034F878` slot 0 (`0x802ACB80`) is what makes this the
/// deleting-destructor arm.
