///   `480c5c91 bl 0x80229190` / `mr r3,r31` / `4e800020 bclr 20,0`.
/// - Evidence: `work/wave278/d_dis.txt`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `this` - the member object (`r3`).
/// * `param_2` - forwarded in `r4` to `0x802AD080`, which ignores it.
