///   / `4bf11369 bl 0x801C0540` / `4bf11319 bl 0x801C0500` / the three
///   `fneg` at `0x802AF200..0x802AF208` / `4bf1a729 bl 0x801C9940` /
///   `4bf1a841 bl 0x801C9A60`.
